      "short": "SQL Injection",
      "desc": "Manipulating database queries through unvalidated input.",
      "title": "CWE-89: SQL Injection",
      "sub": "The crown jewel of web vulnerabilities",
      "category": "Threats & Attacks",
      "cover": "covers/sqli.webp",
      "toc": [
        {
          "id": "sec-what-is-sql",
