        },
        {
          "id": "sec-mitigation-strategies",
          "text": "Mitigation Strategies"
        }
      ],
      "quote": "Remember: SQL Injection thrives where trust is misplaced. Validate, parameterize, and never trust user input.",
      "review": [
        {
          "q": "What is SQL Injection?",
          "a": "Inserting malicious SQL via unvalidated input to manipulate database operations."
        },
        {
          "q": "What does ' OR '1'='1 do?",
          "a": "Makes the WHERE clause always true, bypassing login authentication."
        },
        {
          "q": "Best prevention for SQLi?",
          "a": "Prepared statements: input is treated as data, never as executable SQL."
        },
        {
          "q": "What else can SQLi lead to?",
          "a": "RCE via database features like xp_cmdshell; full server compromise."
        }
      ],
      "terms": [
